name biblatex-apa6
category Package
revision 56209
shortdesc BibLaTeX citation and reference style for APA 6th Edition
longdesc This is a fairly complete BibLaTeX style (citations and
longdesc references) for APA (American Psychological Association) 6th
longdesc Edition conformant publications. It implements and automates
longdesc most of the guidelines in the APA 6th edition style guide for
longdesc citations and references. An example document is also given
longdesc which typesets every citation and reference example in the APA
longdesc 6th edition style guide. This is a legacy style for 6th Edition
longdesc documents. Please use the BibLaTeX-apa style package for the
longdesc latest APA edition conformance.
